<h1>⚠️ Short Link Expiring Soon</h1>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>This is a friendly reminder that one of your shortened URLs will expire in <span class="highlight">{{hoursLeft}} hours</span>.</p>

<p>Expiring short link:</p>
<div class="url-box">
  {{shortUrl}}
</div>

<p style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 4px; color: #6E6E80;">
  Original URL: <a href="{{longUrl}}" style="color: #6E6E80; word-break: break-all;">{{longUrl}}</a>
</p>

<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0;">
  <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #2A2A3E;">
    <td style="padding: 10px 0; color: #A0A0B0; font-weight: bold; width: 140px;">Expiry Time:</td>
    <td style="padding: 10px 0; color: #FFFFFF;">{{expiresAt}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<div class="stat-box" style="border-left-color: #FF5252; background: rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.05); color: #FF5252; font-size: 14px;">
  💡 Once expired, visitors clicking this short link will see a "Link Expired" warning page and will not be redirected. Short links cannot be renewed or extended.
</div>

<div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center;">
  <a href="{{appUrl}}" class="btn" style="margin: 0;">Create New Link 🔗</a>
  <a href="{{appUrl}}/analytics/{{shortCode}}" class="btn" style="margin: 0; background: transparent; border: 1px solid #6C63FF; color: #6C63FF;">View Analytics 📊</a>
</div>
